---
description: Use MEX architectural memory before repository work
alwaysApply: true
---

Before working on the repository:

1. Read `.mex/AGENTS.md`.
2. Read `.mex/ROUTER.md`.
3. Load only the context files selected by the router.
4. Check `.mex/patterns/INDEX.md` before implementation.
5. Prefer MEX graph queries over reading complete files.
6. Before changing an existing symbol, inspect its impact.
7. After architectural changes, update the relevant `.mex/context/*.md`.
8. Before completing a task, run:

   npm run mex:graph
   npm run mex:check

Do not store credentials, audit evidence, customer data, reports, tokens, or secrets in `.mex/`.
Do not load the whole `.mex` directory into context.